{
  "id": "29395_suisensuru",
  "headword": "{推薦|すいせん}する",
  "reading": "すいせんする",
  "romaji": "suisensuru",
  "part_of_speech": "suru verb",
  "gloss": "to recommend; to nominate; to endorse",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to recommend; to nominate; to endorse",
      "explanation": "To recommend a person or thing to someone, often formally — a book, a candidate, an applicant. More formal than {勧|すす}める."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "29395_suisensuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "この{本|ほん}を{推薦|すいせん}する。",
      "english": "I recommend this book.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29395_suisensuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{先生|せんせい}が{彼|かれ}を{代表|だいひょう}に{推薦|すいせん}した。",
      "english": "The teacher recommended him as the representative.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29395_suisensuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{大学|だいがく}に{出願|しゅつがん}するため、{教授|きょうじゅ}に{推薦|すいせん}{状|じょう}を{書|か}いてもらった。",
      "english": "I had a professor write a letter of recommendation for my university application.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Pattern: X を Y に {推薦|すいせん}する (recommend X for/as Y).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {推薦|すいせん}{状|じょう}: letter of recommendation\n- {推薦|すいせん}{入試|にゅうし}: admission by recommendation\n- {自|みずか}ら{推薦|すいせん}する: to nominate oneself\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {勧|すす}める: to recommend, to urge — more everyday and personal; {推薦|すいせん} carries a formal, often public or institutional nuance",
